2026-09-24T15:53:01.8528225Z   mirror: |
2026-09-24T15:53:01.8528629Z     SSTATE_MIRRORS = "file://.* http://sstate.yoctoproject.org/all/PATH;downloadfilename=PATH"
2026-09-24T15:53:01.8528992Z   ccache: |
